@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EBF5FB
  BorderColor #2E86C1
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
}
title How to sell: one founder, about 8 hours a week, one new tenant a month
start
:Target list: 100 firms under audit pressure
contractors, factories, hospital groups (100 to 1,000 staff); <<#D6EAF8>>
:40 contacts a month
warm intros first, Arabic LinkedIn second; <<#D6EAF8>>
:12 conversations with the contracts or procurement manager; <<#AED6F1>>
:5 demos of 30 minutes
their logo preloaded, show the sealed opening and audit bundle; <<#85C1E9>>
:2 free first tenders, done with you; <<#5DADE2>>
if (5 of 8 vendors submit and\napproval within 5 working days?) then (yes)
  :Review with the finance approver
  annual plan, two months free; <<#82E0AA>>
  :**1 paying tenant**; <<#58D68D>>
  :Ask for 2 referrals and invite vendors that also buy; <<#D5F5E3>>
else (no)
  :Find out why, fix it, run the next tender; <<#F5B7B1>>
endif
stop
legend right
  **Pitch:** your tenders under your brand, prices sealed until the
  technical scores are locked, audit-ready, for a monthly price.
  ....
  **Objections**
  Excel works : who saw the prices first, and can you prove it?
  We have an ERP : we feed it a clean PO; it has no sealed vendor portal
  Is data safe? : hosted in Saudi Arabia, price files encrypted, every access logged
  Reference App does this : from SAR 187,500 a year; we start at SAR 1,500 a month
endlegend
